但他们最后选了帆船。

1391
01:04:47.180 --> 01:04:49.380
Then Angela looks to Dwight.
然后安吉拉看向德怀特。

1392
01:04:49.620 --> 01:04:50.520
Did he win?
他赢了吗？

1393
01:04:51.180 --> 01:04:51.680
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1394
01:04:52.500 --> 01:04:55.520
He puts his bobblehead in the trash.
他把他的摇头娃娃扔进了垃圾桶。

1395
01:04:56.240 --> 01:05:01.580
Jenna, there was a deleted scene that comes after this where Angela goes up to Pam and
珍娜，在这之后有一个删减片段，安吉拉走到帕姆面前，

1396
01:05:01.580 --> 01:05:04.780
she's teary-eyed, like her voice is wavering.
她眼含泪水，声音都在颤抖。

1397
01:05:04.900 --> 01:05:09.820
And she says, um, can you give me a ride home from work today?
她说，嗯，你今天下班能载我一程吗？

1398
01:05:09.820 --> 01:05:13.100
Because I no longer have a ride home.
因为我没法回家了。

1399
01:05:14.320 --> 01:05:14.460
Yeah.
是啊。

1400
01:05:15.040 --> 01:05:16.400
And Pam says yes.
然后帕姆答应了。

1401
01:05:17.540 --> 01:05:21.260
And then her and Jim give Angela a ride home.
然后她和吉姆开车送安吉拉回家。

1402
01:05:21.900 --> 01:05:23.040
Oh, my God.
天哪。

1403
01:05:23.200 --> 01:05:23.780
This car ride.
这段车程。

1404
01:05:23.900 --> 01:05:25.140
We did shoot this scene.
我们确实拍了这场戏。

1405
01:05:25.320 --> 01:05:26.720
It's in the deleted scenes.
它在删减片段里。

1406
01:05:27.580 --> 01:05:31.540
Angela just barks directions angrily at Jim.
安吉拉只是愤怒地对吉姆大喊大叫指路。

1407
01:05:31.780 --> 01:05:34.280
And then she starts sobbing in the back seat.
然后她开始在后座啜泣。

1408
01:05:34.420 --> 01:05:35.840
And then she's angry again.
接着她又生气了。

1409
01:05:36.320 --> 01:05:39.320
Well, I'll never forget shooting this scene, Angela.
好吧，安吉拉，我永远不会忘记拍摄这场戏的情景。

1410
01:05:39.320 --> 01:05:43.320
Because, I mean, this was a whole location day for us, you know?
因为，我是说，这对我们来说是整整一天的外景拍摄，你知道吗？

1411
01:05:43.520 --> 01:05:47.720
We had this location that was your house and we just dropped you off outside.
我们选了你家作为外景地，然后我们就把你放在外面。

1412
01:05:48.020 --> 01:05:54.340
But they had this really funny joke that there would be like a dozen cats in your window
但他们有个特别好笑的梗，就是你窗户里会有十几只猫，

1413
01:05:54.340 --> 01:05:58.220
staring out the window at you expectantly as we drop you off.
在我们送你下车时，它们会期待地盯着窗外看你。

1414
01:05:58.300 --> 01:06:00.020
And it was so funny.
那真的太搞笑了。

1415
01:06:00.520 --> 01:06:01.680
It was so funny.
太搞笑了。

1416
01:06:01.820 --> 01:06:05.180
I remember they, you know, they had to get a house with like sort of a big front window,
我记得他们，你知道的，他们得找一栋有那种大前窗的房子，

1417
01:06:05.180 --> 01:06:10.860
like a bay window that all the cats could be in so that we could see them from the street.
就像那种凸窗，所有的猫都能待在里面，这样我们从街上就能看到它们。

1418
01:06:11.120 --> 01:06:15.700
But then, you guys, as we were trading messages with Randy Cordray about this episode,
但后来，伙计们，当我们和兰迪·科德雷交流这一集的细节时，

1419
01:06:16.000 --> 01:06:22.260
he sent us the casting sheet of the cats and all their headshots.
他给我们发来了猫咪的选角表和它们所有的头像照。

1420
01:06:22.540 --> 01:06:25.320
It's a sheet of like cat headshots.
那是一张印着猫咪头像的照片表。

1421
01:06:25.320 --> 01:06:26.840
Yes, you guys.
没错，伙计们。

1422
01:06:27.020 --> 01:06:30.380
And here are the names of the 12 cats that played Angela's cats.
这里就是扮演安吉拉猫咪的那12只猫的名字。

1423
01:06:31.220 --> 01:06:46.020
Potato, Prada, Echo, Flame, Prophet, Whisper, Milkman, Sushi, Roswell, Harvey, Hannah, and Milton.
土豆、普拉达、回声、火焰、先知、耳语、送奶工、寿司、罗斯威尔、哈维、汉娜和米尔顿。

1424
01:06:46.500 --> 01:06:49.500
And Roswell looks just like Sunny Cat.
而且罗斯威尔长得跟桑尼猫一模一样。

1425
01:06:49.700 --> 01:06:50.580
He does.
确实。

1426
01:06:50.780 --> 01:06:51.360
My cat.
我的猫。

1427
01:06:51.360 --> 01:06:54.120
Yeah, we have to put that photo in stories.
是啊，我们得把那张照片发到快拍里。

1428
01:06:54.280 --> 01:06:56.920
And also, Randy sent us the photo of Angela Martin's house.
还有，兰迪给我们发了安吉拉·马丁家的照片。

1429
01:06:57.200 --> 01:06:57.540
Yes.
没错。

1430
01:06:57.780 --> 01:07:02.720
So, unfortunately, the scene was deleted, but the cats can get their moment of fame.
所以，很遗憾这场戏被删了，但猫咪们可以拥有它们的高光时刻。

1431
01:07:02.960 --> 01:07:05.360
And we got to do a driving scene together.
而且我们还一起拍了一场开车戏。

1432
01:07:05.520 --> 01:07:05.900
We did.
确实拍了。

1433
01:07:06.500 --> 01:07:11.340
It's very cute because at the end, after we drop you off, Pam turns to Jim and she says,
那段很可爱，因为最后，在我们送你下车后，帕姆转向吉姆说，

1434
01:07:11.500 --> 01:07:14.300
you know what, I'll call her later to check up on her.
你知道吗，我待会儿给她打个电话看看她怎么样。

1435
01:07:14.640 --> 01:07:17.080
And Jim says, she'll hang up on you.
吉姆说，她会挂你电话的。

1436
01:07:17.360 --> 01:07:17.800
Yes.
没错。

1437
01:07:18.000 --> 01:07:19.800
And Pam says, I know.
帕姆说，我知道。

1438
01:07:24.020 --> 01:07:26.820
Well, that would have been our alt tag, right?
好吧，那本来会是我们的备选结尾，对吧？

1439
01:07:26.940 --> 01:07:29.560
The car ride instead of Jim collecting Dwight's weapons.
那段车程本来是用来代替吉姆收缴德怀特武器的戏份。

1440
01:07:29.960 --> 01:07:33.480
But also right at the end, Michael had a great talking head.
但最后还有个迈克尔很棒的访谈片段。

1441
01:07:33.780 --> 01:07:38.660
Yeah, he's standing on the streets of New York and he just sort of says, you know,
是啊，他站在纽约的街头，然后他说，你知道的，

1442
01:07:38.840 --> 01:07:41.540
exciting things can happen when you leave Scranton.
当你离开斯克兰顿时，令人兴奋的事情就会发生。

1443
01:07:41.720 --> 01:07:44.240
Just kind of sums up this storyline for him.
算是总结了他这条故事线。

1444
01:07:44.240 --> 01:07:46.540
Well, got a little tidbit from Randy.
好吧，从兰迪那儿得到个小道消息。

1445
01:07:46.820 --> 01:07:53.180
I didn't notice it the first time I watched it, but in hindsight, it was obvious to me.
我第一次看的时候没注意到，但事后回想起来，对我来说显而易见。

1446
01:07:53.500 --> 01:07:54.320
Oh, yeah.
哦，是啊。

1447
01:07:54.760 --> 01:07:56.320
This scene was a cheat.
这场戏是作弊拍的。

1448
01:07:57.080 --> 01:07:58.940
Steve was not in New York.
史蒂夫当时根本不在纽约。

1449
01:07:59.300 --> 01:08:01.000
Steve was shot on a green screen.
史蒂夫是在绿幕前拍摄的。

1450
01:08:01.180 --> 01:08:05.340
And we digitally added the office building scene behind him.
然后我们用数字技术在他身后加上了办公大楼的背景。

1451
01:08:05.860 --> 01:08:12.960
Randy said we hired this New York-based cinematographer named Alan Pierce to go out and shoot the exterior
兰迪说我们雇了一位名叫艾伦·皮尔斯的纽约摄影师，去拍摄纽约办公大楼的外部镜头，

1452
01:08:12.960 --> 01:08:15.760
of a New York office building with people walking by.
拍人们走过大楼的样子。

1453
01:08:16.400 --> 01:08:18.540
Randy said it was this awesome shot.
兰迪说那是一个非常棒的镜头。

1454
01:08:18.920 --> 01:08:22.840
But we ran into a problem with the cameras on our end.
但我们的摄像机出了点问题。

1455
01:08:23.120 --> 01:08:28.640
So for all you techies out there, we would shoot our show on a Sony 900 digital camera.
所以对于各位技术控，我们当时是用索尼900数字摄像机拍摄节目的。

1456
01:08:28.840 --> 01:08:31.620
It was a very early generation digital camcorder.
那是非常早期的一代数字摄像机。

1457
01:08:31.620 --> 01:08:36.540
And I guess these cameras had very poor color latitude.
我猜这些摄像机的色彩宽容度很差。

1458
01:08:37.040 --> 01:08:37.960
Oh, sure, Jenna.
哦，当然，珍娜。

1459
01:08:38.060 --> 01:08:39.020
You know color latitude.
你懂色彩宽容度。

1460
01:08:39.300 --> 01:08:39.440
I know.
我懂。

1461
01:08:39.580 --> 01:08:39.960
I know.
我懂。

1462
01:08:40.500 --> 01:08:44.040
And when it's not good, it can be tough.
当它表现不好时，确实会很棘手。

1463
01:08:44.240 --> 01:08:45.580
I mean, you know.
我是说，你懂的。

1464
01:08:45.580 --> 01:08:45.640
We know.
我们懂。

1465
01:08:45.900 --> 01:08:46.640
Oh, yeah.
哦，没错。

1466
01:08:46.960 --> 01:08:49.820
How many times have I struggled with my color latitude?
我曾多少次为色彩宽容度而苦恼？

1467
01:08:50.200 --> 01:08:50.860
So many.
太多次了。

1468
01:08:51.160 --> 01:08:53.280
It does not do well shooting on green screen.
它在绿幕拍摄时的表现并不好。

1469
01:08:53.560 --> 01:08:57.080
And Randy said that's why we did it so infrequently.
兰迪说这就是我们很少用绿幕的原因。

1470
01:08:57.860 --> 01:09:00.920
Now, normally, we would just find some place in downtown L.A.
通常情况下，我们会直接在洛杉矶市中心找个地方，

1471
01:09:01.060 --> 01:09:02.200
to double for New York.
来充当纽约的场景。

1472
01:09:02.280 --> 01:09:07.540
But I noticed on the call sheets that we only had Steve for two and a half days this week.
但我注意到通告单上写着这周史蒂夫只有两天半的时间。

1473
01:09:07.680 --> 01:09:10.480
He worked Monday, Tuesday, and part of Wednesday.
他周一、周二工作，周三工作半天。

1474
01:09:10.780 --> 01:09:16.060
And the whole rest of our shoot was really dedicated to that complicated parking lot scene.
而我们剩下的拍摄时间都专门用于那个复杂的停车场场景了。

1475
01:09:16.580 --> 01:09:16.960
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1476
01:09:17.260 --> 01:09:18.740
I asked Randy about it.
我问过兰迪这件事。

1477
01:09:18.900 --> 01:09:24.200
He said he doesn't know exactly why we chose to go green screen.
他说他也不确定为什么我们选择用绿幕。

1478
01:09:24.200 --> 01:09:29.960
But he has to imagine that we just simply did not have time to go downtown and get that shot
但他猜想是因为我们实在没时间去市中心拍那个镜头，

1479
01:09:29.960 --> 01:09:31.880
because it was a complicated shoot week.
因为那一周的拍摄任务太复杂了。

1480
01:09:32.220 --> 01:09:35.560
Well, I didn't catch it on my first watch, but I really did on the second one.
好吧，我第一次看的时候没发现，但第二次看的时候真的看出来了。

1481
01:09:35.680 --> 01:09:36.000
Me too.
我也是。

1482
01:09:36.140 --> 01:09:38.080
I was like, oh, that's fakie backdrop.
我当时就想，哦，那是假背景。

1483
01:09:38.420 --> 01:09:39.260
There you have it.
就是这样。

1484
01:09:39.780 --> 01:09:43.560
Fakie building, fakie shadow, fakie bicycle chain.
假建筑，假阴影，假自行车链条。

1485
01:09:43.900 --> 01:09:45.500
Real feelings, guys.
但感情是真的，伙计们。

1486
01:09:45.940 --> 01:09:46.740
That's the duel.
这就是那场决斗。

1487
01:09:47.000 --> 01:09:49.140
That pretty much sums up the duel.
这基本概括了那场决斗。

1488
01:09:50.980 --> 01:09:51.620
All right.
好的。

1489
01:09:51.760 --> 01:09:55.220
Well, thank you to everyone who contributed to this episode.
那么，感谢每一位为本集做出贡献的人。

1490
01:09:55.480 --> 01:10:00.680
Thank you, Ryan Coe, for calling in and giving us the story of your tragic fall.
谢谢你，瑞安·科，打来电话为我们讲述你那悲惨的摔倒故事。

1491
01:10:01.240 --> 01:10:01.440
Yes.
是的。

1492
01:10:01.620 --> 01:10:02.200
Thank you, Ryan.
谢谢你，瑞安。

1493
01:10:02.380 --> 01:10:04.560
And we're going to be back here next week, guys.
伙计们，我们下周会回到这里。

1494
01:10:04.560 --> 01:10:06.780
We have Prince Family Paper.
我们要聊《王子家族造纸公司》那一集。

1495
01:10:07.080 --> 01:10:07.980
I'm going to be honeSt.
老实说，

1496
01:10:07.980 --> 01:10:09.840
I do not remember the plot of that one.
我不记得那一集的剧情了。

1497
01:10:10.060 --> 01:10:10.840
Who's Prince?
谁是王子？

1498
01:10:11.300 --> 01:10:11.960
Who are they?
他们是谁？

1499
01:10:12.180 --> 01:10:13.700
We're going to find out next week.
我们下周就会知道了。

1500
01:10:13.800 --> 01:10:14.660
We're going to find out.
我们一定会知道的。

1501
01:10:14.820 --> 01:10:16.100
I feel like a real audience member.
我感觉自己就像个真正的观众。

1502
01:10:16.240 --> 01:10:17.080
I don't know what's coming.
我不知道接下来会发生什么。

1503
01:10:17.540 --> 01:10:20.840
I'm sure I'll remember after I watch the episode, but I can't wait.
我相信看完这集我就会想起来了，但我已经迫不及待了。

1504
01:10:21.040 --> 01:10:21.500
Hopefully.
希望如此。

1505
01:10:21.940 --> 01:10:22.720
I hope so.
我也希望如此。

1506
01:10:23.420 --> 01:10:24.240
See you guys.
再见，各位。

1507
01:10:24.460 --> 01:10:25.100
Have a great one.
祝你们过得愉快。

1508
01:10:25.220 --> 01:10:25.620
Bye.
再见。

1509
01:10:29.540 --> 01:10:31.480
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies.
感谢收听《办公室女士》。

1510
